"description": "Cadre Holdings, Inc. engages in the manufacture and distribution of safety and survivability products, and other related products for the law enforcement, first responder and military markets. It operates through the following segments: Product and Distribution. The Product segment consists of components that manufacture and sell products. The Distribution segment refers to businesses that serve as a one-stop shop for law enforcement agencies that sell goods produced by the product segment and other third-party products. The company was founded on April 12, 2012 and is headquartered in Jacksonville, FL.",
